[13.842527, "o", "\r\n"]
[56.094987, "o", "sealed-bid demo · sealedbid-agent-a (buyer) ↔ sealedbid-agent-b (seller) · label demo-1788636289\r\n  vet_a           reputation.lookup $0.01 → HTTP 200 tx=0xdb0d4e5e308ce6292c0634790b048e881c6dae698c80fc363ce997a8e69d4c40\r\n  vet_a/prehire   agent.prehire-check $0.25 → HTTP 200 tx=0xc6dc6a10c9fed4f6c355e7bcb9528c330bcfc8e1bc1c611fa648cbeed7db7e1d\r\n  vet_b           reputation.lookup $0.01 → HTTP 200 tx=0xf80c5640ac46deaac37dd9543fcc088f59492eb97f3451b1f1d573adf04830eb\r\n  vet_b/prehire   agent.prehire-check $0.25 → HTTP 200 tx=0x19ee0512435e89ff5ddc1fe810d53e938bf1d2836a2f5e977fc7f6c4361efbfd\r\n  bracket_open    agent.trust-badge $0.01 → HTTP 200 tx=0xe3fa4b451d24b7e8c1bd00e9a9e69a1f4e045998ef0a5c9114702ede6c134bcf\r\n  seal            cre workflow simulate --target=simulation-settings --broadcast …\r\n                  enclave says: 'SETTLE @ 105 (run: simulation) tx: 0xd263e9d95c54be46c83c2574dee979ecbb5838574b686c51212bc6cce4f9cb82'  runId=0xf16585fc1a933e0a43d537a20609f4d3c1847a5bddb7247f99d349de50204480\r\n  settle          receiver 0xA2eB7d6E… holds clearing=105000000 micro (matches) recordedAt=1788636328 count=5\r\n  transfer        A → B 105000000 wei on Base Sepolia, tx=0x787ba447612ee823c55ed014f0615e5df34628f281298734e20d3a0286e9b399 block=46434021 status=1\r\n  bracket_close   reputation.lookup $0.01 → HTTP 200 tx=0xb77af018206d38949689da5b81396d1f15ad1d7ed5322eb4592edddc3209072b\r\n\r\nresult: SETTLE @ 105 (run: simulation) tx: 0xd263e9d95c54be46c83c2574dee979ecbb5838574b686c51212bc6cce4f9cb82   evidence: evidence/demo/0xf16585fc1a933e0a43d537a20609f4d3c1847a5bddb7247f99d349de50204480.json   chain verifies: True\r\nreserves in the evidence file: none (checked)\r\n"]
